        "login": "Haroenv",
        "type": "User"
      },
      "body": "Just checked and I confirm that you can’t preselect a value, but I think this also wasn’t possible in v1 from reading the docs. We should probably add this option.",
      "date": 1503049956,
      "reactions": {},
      "id": 323311623
    },
    {
      "user": {
        "avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123822",
        "id": 123822,
        "login": "vvo",
        "type": "User"
      },
      "body": "The solution is this:\r\n\r\n```\r\ninstantsearch({searchParameters: {hitsPerPage: 3}})\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo that no matter if you use our widgets you can always set it at the top level.",
      "date": 1503936859,
      "reactions": {
        "👍️": 1
